{"type":"message","id":"9d5e362f","parentId":"b79a5014","timestamp":"2026-06-16T05:08:36.581Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. All 3 positions have active take profit and stop loss orders:\n\nBNB: TP 607.7, SL 617.8 (both active, status NEW)\nLINK: TP 7.94, SL 8.43 (both active, status NEW)\nDOT: TP 0.973, SL 1.03 (both active, status NEW)\n\nBut the question is about whether the \"弹性移动止盈止损\" (dynamic trailing stop-loss) feature is running - meaning, are these SL/TP prices being dynamically adjusted by the monitor as prices move?\n\nLet me check the monitor process and the trailing logic. Let me look at the crypto_state.json more carefully and also check the monitor process.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_qTz4ai2BxqK7yWSOcVwA7484","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nstate = Path('crypto_state.json')\nif state.exists():\n    data = json.loads(state.read_text())\n    # 只看可能和止盈止损相关的\n    keys = list(data.keys())\n    print('crypto_state.json 所有字段:')\n    for k in keys:\n        print(f'  {k}: {data[k] if not isinstance(data[k], (dict,list)) else type(data[k]).__name__}')\n    # 时间戳\n    if 'last_tp_sl_update' in data:\n        from datetime import datetime\n        ts = data['last_tp_sl_update']\n        print(f'\\n上次SL/TP更新时间: {datetime.fromtimestamp(ts).strftime(\\\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\\\")}')\n    if 'last_monitor_cycle' in data:\n        from datetime import datetime\n        ts = data['last_monitor_cycle']\n        print(f'上次监控周期: {datetime.fromtimestamp(ts).strftime(\\\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\\\")}')\nelse:\n    print('crypto_state.json 不存在')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1758,"output":634,"cacheRead":24960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27352,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":