{"type":"message","id":"040e0d8c","parentId":"a64a7577","timestamp":"2026-06-16T05:17:01.992Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公说的是弹性移动止盈止损的\"倍率\"——ATR倍率。SOUL.md里写的是：\n\nATR倍数: <2%→1.0, <4%→1.5, ≥4%→2.0\n\n这个是在智能止盈止损计算里用的，不是三档移动止盈。让我查一下这个逻辑在代码里是否还在运行。\n\n让我搜索代码中关于ATR倍率的相关逻辑。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_jzW1QsQd8EQ0pU2C0yar9687","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && grep -n \"atr_mul\\|ATR.*倍\\|atr.*tier\\|ATR.*分层\\|4%.*2.0\\|atr_multiplier\\|dynamic.*atr\\|弹性\" crypto_signal_monitor.py | head -20","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":417,"output":314,"cacheRead":33408,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34139,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781587016470}}
{"type":"message","id":"a9d98901","parentId":"040e0d8c","timestamp":"2026-06-16T05:17:02.128Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_jzW1QsQd8EQ0pU2C0yar9687","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"94:    # ATR止损倍数分层\n95:    \"atr_sl_tiers\": [\n96:        (0.02, 1.0),   # ATR% < 2%  →  止损1.0倍ATR\n97:        (0.04, 1.5),   # ATR% < 4%  →  止损1.5倍ATR\n98:        (9999, 2.0),   # ATR% >= 4% →  止损2.0倍ATR\n598:    - 止损：max(2%, ATR% × 分层倍数)，防止止损价被行情轻易打穿\n599:      atr_sl_tiers: <2%ATR→1.0x, <4%→1.5x, ≥4%→2.0x\n616:    atr_mult = 1.0  # 默认 1 倍\n618:        atr_tiers = CONFIG.get(\"atr_sl_tiers\", [(0.02, 1.0), (0.04, 1.5), (9999, 2.0)])\n619:        for threshold, mult in atr_tiers:\n621:                atr_mult = mult\n623:    sl_pct = max(MIN_SL_PCT, min(atr_pct * atr_mult, MAX_SL_PCT))"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":92,"aggregated":"94:    # ATR止损倍数分层\n95:    \"atr_sl_tiers\": [\n96:        (0.02, 1.0),   # ATR% < 2%  →  止损1.0倍ATR\n97:        (0.04, 1.5),   # ATR% < 4%  →  止损1.5倍ATR\n98:        (9999, 2.0),   # ATR% >= 4% →  止损2.0倍ATR\n598:    - 止损：max(2%, ATR% × 分层倍数)，防止止损价被行情轻易打穿\n599:      atr_sl_tiers: <2%ATR→1.0x, <4%→1.5x, ≥4%→2.0x\n616:    atr_mult = 1.0  # 默认 1 倍\n618:        atr_tiers = CONFIG.get(\"atr_sl_tiers\", [(0.02, 1.0), (0.04, 1.5), (9999, 2.0)])\n619:        for threshold, mult in atr_tiers:\n621:                atr_mult = mult\n623:    sl_pct = max(MIN_SL_PCT, min(atr_pct * atr_mult, MAX_SL_PCT))","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1781587022121}}
{"type":"message","id":"0d4d7b4d","parentId":"a9d98901","timestamp":"2026-06-16T05:17:05.400Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found it. The ATR multiplier tiers are in the code and are used in the SL calculation. Let me look at the full context of this function to understand how it's being used and whether it's actively running.\n\nLet me read the relevant section around line 598-640 to see the full function.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_CXfZKGaHFN303dRHJbvZ2605","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && sed -n '590,660p' crypto_signal_monitor.py","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":444,"output":210,"cacheRead":33920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34574,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781587022131}}
{"type":"message","id":"09c482b1","parentId":"0d4d7b4d","timestamp":"2026-06-16T05:17:05.543Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_CXfZKGaHFN303dRHJbvZ2605","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}\n\n    2026-06-03 老公指示：止损改为 ATR 动态 + 2% 保底\n    - 止盈：+4%（TP1 全平 100%）\n    - 止损：max(2%, ATR% × 分层倍数)，防止止损价被行情轻易打穿\n      atr_sl_tiers: <2%ATR→1.0x, <4%→1.5x, ≥4%→2.0x\n    - 无 TP2（已废弃）\n    \"\"\"\n    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 保底 4%（2026-03-30 老公指示）\n    TP_MAX_PCT      = 0.15  # 止盈上限 15%\n    MIN_SL_PCT      = 0.02  # 保底 2%\n    MAX_SL_PCT      = 0.15  # 2026-06-06: 止损上限 15%，防止极端 ATR 下止损失控\n\n    # ── ATR 动态止盈止损 ──\n    atr_pct = ind.get(\"atr_pct\", 0) if ind else 0\n\n    # 2026-06-06 老公指示：止盈 ATR 动态，崩盘时自动放宽\n    tp_pct = TAKE_PROFIT_PCT\n    if atr_pct > 0:\n        tp_pct = max(TAKE_PROFIT_PCT, min(atr_pct * 2.0, TP_MAX_PCT))\n\n    # ATR 动态止损距离\n    atr_mult = 1.0  # 默认 1 倍\n    if atr_pct > 0:\n        atr_tiers = CONFIG.get(\"atr_sl_tiers\", [(0.02, 1.0), (0.04, 1.5), (9999, 2.0)])\n        for threshold, mult in atr_tiers:\n            if atr_pct < threshold:\n                atr_mult = mult\n                break\n    sl_pct = max(MIN_SL_PCT, min(atr_pct * atr_mult, MAX_SL_PCT))\n\n    if direction == \"LONG\":\n        tp1 = entry * (1 + tp_pct)\n        sl  = entry * (1 - sl_pct)\n    else:\n        tp1 = entry * (1 - tp_pct)\n        sl  = entry * (1 + sl_pct)\n\n    return {\n        \"tp1_price\": round(tp1, 4),\n        \"sl_price\":  round(sl, 4),\n        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,        # 移动止盈用\n        \"tp_pct\":    round(tp_pct, 4),  # 2026-06-06: 记录动态止盈比例\n    }\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 七、止盈止损检查（15秒必跑，极轻量）\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\ndef check_exits_fast(positions: list, prices: dict) -> list[tuple]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 [(position, reason, close_size_ratio)]\n    纯价格比较，无任何计算，<5ms\n    \n    2026-03-28 老公指示：TP1 全平，无 TP2\n    \"\"\"\n    exits = []\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        p   = prices.get(sym, {}).get(\"price\")\n        if not p:\n            continue\n\n        tp1 = pos[\"tp1_price\"]\n        sl  = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n        \n        # 跳过止盈止损为 0 的无效持仓"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":110,"aggregated":"ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}\n\n    2026-06-03 老公指示：止损改为 ATR 动态 + 2% 保底\n    - 止盈：+4%（TP1 全平 100%）\n    - 止损：max(2%, ATR% × 分层倍数)，防止止损价被行情轻易打穿\n      atr_sl_tiers: <2%ATR→1.0x, <4%→1.5x, ≥4%→2.0x\n    - 无 TP2（已废弃）\n    \"\"\"\n    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 保底 4%（2026-03-30 老公指示）\n    TP_MAX_PCT      = 0.15  # 止盈上限 15%\n    MIN_SL_PCT      = 0.02  # 保底 2%\n    MAX_SL_PCT      = 0.15  # 2026-06-06: 止损上限 15%，防止极端 ATR 下止损失控\n\n    # ── ATR 动态止盈止损 ──\n    atr_pct = ind.get(\"atr_pct\", 0) if ind else 0\n\n    # 2026-06-06 老公指示：止盈 ATR 动态，崩盘时自动放宽\n    tp_pct = TAKE_PROFIT_PCT\n    if atr_pct > 0:\n        tp_pct = max(TAKE_PROFIT_PCT, min(atr_pct * 2.0, TP_MAX_PCT))\n\n    # ATR 动态止损距离\n    atr_mult = 1.0  # 默认 1 倍\n    if atr_pct > 0:\n        atr_tiers = CONFIG.get(\"atr_sl_tiers\", [(0.02, 1.0), (0.04, 1.5), (9999, 2.0)])\n        for threshold, mult in atr_tiers:\n            if atr_pct < threshold:\n                atr_mult = mult\n                break\n    sl_pct = max(MIN_SL_PCT, min(atr_pct * atr_mult, MAX_SL_PCT))\n\n    if direction == \"LONG\":\n        tp1 = entry * (1 + tp_pct)\n        sl  = entry * (1 - sl_pct)\n    else:\n        tp1 = entry * (1 - tp_pct)\n        sl  = entry * (1 + sl_pct)\n\n    return {\n        \"tp1_price\": round(tp1, 4),\n        \"sl_price\":  round(sl, 4),\n        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,        # 移动止盈用\n        \"tp_pct\":    round(tp_pct, 4),  # 2026-06-06: 记录动态止盈比例\n    }\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 七、止盈止损检查（15秒必跑，极轻量）\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\ndef check_exits_fast(positions: list, prices: dict) -> list[tuple]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 [(position, reason, close_size_ratio)]\n    纯价格比较，无任何计算，<5ms\n    \n    2026-03-28 老公指示：TP1 全平，无 TP2\n    \"\"\"\n    exits = []\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        p   = prices.get(sym, {}).get(\"price\")\n        if not p:\n            continue\n\n        tp1 = pos[\"tp1_price\"]\n        sl  = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n        \n        # 跳过止盈止损为 0 的无效持仓","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1781587025533}}
{"type":"message","id":"0562864c","parentId":"09c482b1","timestamp":"2026-06-16T05:17:25.169Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand. The ATR-based dynamic multiplier is used in the `calc_tp_sl` function when a position is OPENED. The ATR multiplier tiers (4%-15% range that老公 mentioned) affect the stop loss calculation:\n\n- ATR < 2% → SL = 1.0x ATR (minimum 2%)\n- ATR < 4% → SL = 1.5x ATR\n- ATR ≥ 4% → SL = 2.0x ATR (maximum 15%)\n\nAnd the take profit also uses ATR dynamically:\n- tp_pct = max(4%, min(atr_pct * 2.0, 15%))\n\nSo 老公 is asking about whether this ATR-based elastic multiplier system is still running correctly. It IS still in the code and would be applied when new positions are opened. But for EXISTING positions, the SL/TP was set at entry time based on the ATR at that time.\n\nNow, is there also a runtime adjustment of SL/TP based on changing ATR? Let me check if the monitor updates SL based on ATR changes for open positions...\n\nLooking at the code flow:\n- `update_trailing_stop` (line 681) adjusts SL based on peak_pnl and trailing tiers\n- `calc_tp_sl` (line 590) is called when OPENING a position\n- I don't see a function that continuously re-adjusts SL based on changing ATR during the life of a position\n\nThe trailing stop (三档) handles the price-driven adjustment. The ATR multiplier is applied at entry time.\n\nBut 老公 specifically said \"4%-15%的那个\" - the 15% comes from `MAX_SL_PCT = 0.15` and `TP_MAX_PCT = 0.15`. This is clearly the ATR dynamic scaling.\n\nLet me verify: is the ATR dynamic system in use for the current positions? These positions were opened with tp_pct = 0.04 (4%), which means either ATR was very low when they were opened or the default was used. The current SL levels show: BNB SL=617.8 (~2.4% from entry), DOT SL=1.034 (~2% from entry), LINK SL=8.43 (~2% from entry). All around 2%, suggesting ATR was low.\n\nNow, the question is whether this system is actively running and adjusting these based on current ATR, or only at entry time. Based on the code, it's only at entry time. The trailing stop handles ongoing adjustments, but not the ATR multiplier.\n\nSo I need to tell 老公:\n1. ATR动态倍率逻辑在 `calc_tp_sl` 里，开仓时生效\n2. 当前三个仓位开仓时ATR较低，所以SL都按保底2%设的\n3. 这个机制没有运行时动态更新——运行时靠三档移动止盈来跟进\n4. 如果要让ATR倍率也在持仓期间动态生效，需要改代码\n\nActually wait, let me re-read老公's question. He said \"这个我知道我说的是4%-15%的那个\" - he knows about the basic trailing stop but is specifically asking about the 4%-15% range, which is the ATR dynamic scaling. He wants to know if it's still running.\n\nThe answer is: yes, the code is still there and it's used at position entry time (`calc_tp_sl`). But it doesn't dynamically re-adjust existing positions based on changing ATR. If he wants that, it would need a code change.\n\nLet me give a clear answer.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"老公说的对，就是 `calc_tp_sl` 里的 ATR 动态分层倍率。还在跑，但只在**开仓时用一次**：\n\n```python\n# ATR 动态止盈：max(4%, min(atr×2.0, 15%))\n# ATR 动态止损：max(2%, min(atr×分层倍数, 15%))\n#   分层: <2%ATR→1.0x | <4%→1.5x | ≥4%→2.0x\n```\n\n当前三个仓位开仓时 ATR 都低，所以 SL 按保底 2% 设的（BNB 2.4%、DOT 2%、LINK 2%），TP 按保底 4% 设的。\n\n问题是开仓之后 ATR 变了，这个倍率不会动态跟上——它不像三档移动止盈那样每个周期跑。持仓期只靠三档移动止盈在跟。\n\n要让 ATR 倍率运行时也动态刷新吗？比如行情突然波动大了自动放宽止损？要的话我改。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":955,"output":1786,"cacheRead":34432,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37173,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781587025546}}
