{"type":"message","id":"513f5ee5","parentId":"67e09b2a","timestamp":"2026-06-16T05:21:01.761Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. Let me implement the changes.\n\nThe flow is:\n1. `update_trailing_stop(positions, prices)` - adjusts SL based on 3-tier trailing stop\n2. `save_positions(positions)` - saves to file\n3. Then indicators are calculated (every 60s)\n4. Then other steps...\n\nI need to:\n1. Add an `update_atr_dynamic_stops(positions, indicators)` function\n2. Call it AFTER indicators are updated, OR alongside `update_trailing_stop` using cached indicators\n\nSince indicators are calculated every 60s and the main loop runs every 15s, I should call it right after the indicator update section to use fresh indicators. But the trailing stop runs every cycle and uses cached `positions`...\n\nActually, the cleanest approach: call `update_atr_dynamic_stops` right after indicators are calculated (inside the `if scheduler.should(\"indicators\"):` block), and use the SL/TP recalculation formula from `calc_tp_sl`.\n\nWait, actually I should put it after the indicators block so it runs every 60s (same as indicator refresh rate):\n```python\nif scheduler.should(\"indicators\"):\n    for sym in CONFIG[\"symbols\"]:\n        ind = indicator_engine.calc(sym)\n        if ind:\n            indicators[sym] = ind\n    # ATR 动态止损更新（每次指标刷新时跟新）\n    update_atr_dynamic_stops(positions, indicators)\n    save_positions(positions)\n```\n\nBut then `save_positions` is called twice (once after trailing_stop, once here). That's harmless but a bit wasteful.\n\nActually, let me put it differently. I'll modify the trailing_stop call to also take indicators, and handle ATR logic inside it OR right after:\n\nBetter approach: add a new separate function and call it after indicators are updated:\n\n```python\nif scheduler.should(\"indicators\"):\n    for sym in CONFIG[\"symbols\"]:\n        ind = indicator_engine.calc(sym)\n        if ind:\n            indicators[sym] = ind\n    # ATR动态止损更新\n    if update_atr_dynamic_stops(positions, indicators):\n        save_positions(positions)  # only save if something changed\n```\n\nThis way it only runs every 60s and only saves if changes were made.\n\nLet me write the function now. I'll insert it before `_cancel_algo_by_type`.\n\nFor the function:\n1. For each position, get current ATR from indicators\n2. Calculate recommended SL using the same ATR multiplier logic as calc_tp_sl\n3. Only update if the position hasn't reached trailing Tier 1 (peak_pnl < tp_pct * 0.5)\n4. Always update to the current ATR-based recommended SL\n5. Sync to Binance\n\nLet me code it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"就改一个文件：`crypto_signal_monitor.py`。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_BoARX6KX7qlbn8rhoQim5322","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","old_string":"def _cancel_algo_by_type(symbol_usdt: str, order_type: str):","new_string":"def update_atr_dynamic_stops(positions: list, indicators: dict) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    ATR 动态止损 — 持仓期间实时跟新。\n    用当前 ATR 重算止损距离，只在未进入移动止盈档位时生效。\n    \n    2026-06-16 老公指示：ATR 倍率（4%-15%）应该在持仓期也动态跑，\n    而不只是开仓时算一次。行情波动大了自动放宽，小了自动收紧。\n    \"\"\"\n    changed = False\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        ind = indicators.get(sym)\n        if not ind:\n            continue\n        \n        atr_pct = ind.get(\"atr_pct\", 0)\n        if atr_pct <= 0:\n            continue\n        \n        entry = pos[\"entry_price\"]\n        typ = pos[\"type\"]\n        tp_pct = pos.get(\"tp_pct\", 0.04)\n        \n        # 已进入移动止盈档位 → 三档跟止损接管，ATR 不干预\n        peak_pnl = pos.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0)\n        first_tier_threshold = tp_pct * CONFIG[\"trailing_tiers\"][0][\"pnl_ratio\"]\n        if peak_pnl >= first_tier_threshold:\n            continue\n        \n        # ATR 分层倍率（与 calc_tp_sl 一致）\n        atr_mult = 1.0\n        for threshold, mult in CONFIG[\"atr_sl_tiers\"]:\n            if atr_pct < threshold:\n                atr_mult = mult\n                break\n        \n        sl_pct = max(0.02, min(atr_pct * atr_mult, 0.15))\n        \n        if typ == \"LONG\":\n            atr_sl = round(entry * (1 - sl_pct), 4)\n            if abs(atr_sl - pos[\"sl_price\"]) > 1e-8:\n                old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n                pos[\"sl_price\"] = atr_sl\n                sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, atr_sl, old_sl, pos.get(\"tp1_price\", 0),\n                                          qty=abs(pos.get(\"amount\", 0)))\n                changed = True\n        else:  # SHORT\n            atr_sl = round(entry * (1 + sl_pct), 4)\n            if abs(atr_sl - pos[\"sl_price\"]) > 1e-8:\n                old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n                pos[\"sl_price\"] = atr_sl\n                sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, atr_sl, old_sl, pos.get(\"tp1_price\", 0),\n                                          qty=abs(pos.get(\"amount\", 0)))\n                changed = True\n    \n    return changed\n\n\ndef _cancel_algo_by_type(symbol_usdt: str, order_type: str):"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":135,"output":1996,"cacheRead":44416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46547,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781587241701}}
