{"type":"message","id":"d526997e","parentId":"7db6ad0e","timestamp":"2026-06-16T05:23:22.537Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Let me summarize the changes for 老公.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"加了三道保险，不会炸：\n\n1. **5 分钟冷却** — 同币种两次更新间隔至少 300 秒，不会每 60 秒就取消重建\n2. **0.1% 变化门槛** — 止损价格变化不到 0.1% 直接跳过，ATR 在同一个分层里小波动不触发\n3. **层级变化才动手** — 只有 ATR 从 `<2%` 跳到 `<4%` 档（或反过来）时才真正向 Binance 发请求\n\n极端情况每秒一次也不可能炸——Binance 限频 1200/min，我们的频率撑死 0.2 次/min，差三个数量级。\n\n可以放心 `kj` 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":107,"output":182,"cacheRead":50304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50593,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781587397985}}
