{"type":"message","id":"da2394ac","parentId":"17e321b6","timestamp":"2026-06-16T09:15:12.652Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公说\"嗯\"让我改。我需要修改启动时重建持仓的逻辑，把旧持仓的SL/TP/peak数据保留下来。\n\n关键改动：\n1. 在启动重建持仓时，先查 old_positions 里同币种的数据\n2. 对比：如果旧 SL 更紧（对持仓更有利），保留旧 SL；否则用新的 calc_tp_sl 结果\n3. 恢复 peak_pnl、peak_price、tp_pct 等关键字段\n\n对于 SHORT 持仓，\"更紧\"的 SL 是更低的数值（离当前价格更近）。\n对于 LONG 持仓，\"更紧\"的 SL 是更高的数值。\n\n具体逻辑：\n- SHORT: `old_sl < new_sl` → 旧 SL 更紧，保留\n- LONG: `old_sl > new_sl` → 旧 SL 更紧，保留\n\n同时必须保留 peak_pnl 和 peak_price，这样重启后三档移动止盈还能从正确的位置继续。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_KaU1KBDpVsV6PL8nO1tg8157","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","offset":2349,"limit":75}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1630,"output":524,"cacheRead":56320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58474,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781601305122}}
{"type":"message","id":"5e8eae3c","parentId":"da2394ac","timestamp":"2026-06-16T09:15:12.822Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_KaU1KBDpVsV6PL8nO1tg8157","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                log.warning(\"⚠️ 本地文件也无持仓，初始化为空\")\n        else:\n            # 2026-03-28 老公指示：先加载本地缓存，保留止盈止损\n            old_positions = load_positions()\n            log.info(f'📊 加载本地缓存 {len(old_positions)} 个持仓用于保留止盈止损')\n            \n            # 过滤有实际持仓的币种\n            positions = []\n            for p in api_positions:\n                amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n                entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：过滤粉尘仓位（名义价值<$5 不纳入）\n                if amt != 0 and abs(amt) * entry >= 5.0:\n                    # 转换为本地格式\n                    symbol = p['symbol']\n                    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：用新百分比重新计算止盈止损（4%/2%）\n                    entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                    direction = 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG'\n                    tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {})  # 重新计算，不保留旧缓存\n                    \n                    pos = {\n                        'symbol': symbol,\n                        'type': direction,\n                        'entry_price': entry,\n                        'entry_time': datetime.now().isoformat(),\n                        'qty': abs(amt),\n                        'amount': abs(amt),\n                        'score': 55,\n                        'regime': 'trending',\n                        'ai_result': None,\n                        'order_result': {'success': True, 'message': '从 API 同步'},\n                        'high_24h': 0.0,\n                        'low_24h': 0.0,\n                        'tp1_price': tp_sl['tp1_price'],\n                        'sl_price': tp_sl['sl_price'],\n                        'peak_pnl': 0.0,\n                        'tp_pct': tp_sl.get('tp_pct', 0.04),\n                    }\n                    positions.append(pos)\n                    log.info(f\"✅ 同步持仓：{symbol} {pos['type']} @ ${pos['entry_price']:.2f}\")\n        save_positions(positions)\n        log.info(f\"✅ 持仓同步完成：{len(positions)}个\")\n        \n        # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：启动时清理不属于任何持仓的孤儿 Algo 条件单\n        if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n            position_symbols = {p.get('symbol', '') for p in positions}\n            try:\n                all_algos = request(\"GET\", \"/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders\", {})\n                if isinstance(all_algos, list):\n                    orphan_count = 0\n                    for a in all_algos:\n                        sym_raw = a.get('symbol', '')\n                        sym = sym_raw.replace('USDT', '') if sym_raw else ''\n                        if sym and sym not in position_symbols:\n                            algo_id = a.get('algoId')\n                            if algo_id:\n                                try:\n                                    request(\"DELETE\", \"/fapi/v1/algoOrder\", {\"algoId\": algo_id})\n                                    orphan_count += 1\n                                    log.info(f\"🗑️ 启动清理孤儿 Algo 单：{sym} algoId={algo_id}\")\n                                except Exception:\n                                    pass\n                    if orphan_count > 0:\n                        log.info(f\"🗑️ 启动清理完成：{orphan_count} 个孤儿 Algo 单\")\n            except Exception as e:\n                log.warning(f\"⚠️ 启动清理 Algo 单异常：{e}\")\n        \n        # 🐛 仓位反转修复：启动时为从 API 同步的每个持仓提交止盈止损 Algo 单\n        for pos in positions:\n            submit_initial_algo_orders(pos)\n    except Exception as e:\n        log.error(f\"❌ 持仓同步失败：{e}\")\n        positions = load_positions()  # 回退到本地文件\n\n    # 从状态文件恢复上次推送时间、峰值盈亏；今日已实现由 restore_daily_pnl 校准\n\n[534 more lines in file. Use offset=2424 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781601312812}}
{"type":"message","id":"9ce3dca0","parentId":"5e8eae3c","timestamp":"2026-06-16T09:15:40.188Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to modify the startup code to:\n1. Use old_positions data (sl_price, tp1_price, peak_pnl, peak_price, tp_pct) to preserve trailing stop progress\n2. Only use calc_tp_sl as a fallback when there's no old data for a symbol\n\nThe key logic:\n- Build an old_pos map by symbol for quick lookup\n- For each API position, look up old data\n- If old data exists:\n  - Compare SL: if old SL is tighter (SHORT: lower, LONG: higher), keep old SL; else use new\n  - Keep old peak_pnl, peak_price, tp_pct\n  - Keep old tp1_price (it was set at entry and shouldn't change)\n- If no old data: use calc_tp_sl defaults\n\nLet me write this edit.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_0g38DjoVPXAoq2I3jfj29988","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","old_string":"        else:\n            # 2026-03-28 老公指示：先加载本地缓存，保留止盈止损\n            old_positions = load_positions()\n            log.info(f'📊 加载本地缓存 {len(old_positions)} 个持仓用于保留止盈止损')\n            \n            # 过滤有实际持仓的币种\n            positions = []\n            for p in api_positions:\n                amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n                entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：过滤粉尘仓位（名义价值<$5 不纳入）\n                if amt != 0 and abs(amt) * entry >= 5.0:\n                    # 转换为本地格式\n                    symbol = p['symbol']\n                    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：用新百分比重新计算止盈止损（4%/2%）\n                    entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                    direction = 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG'\n                    tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {})  # 重新计算，不保留旧缓存\n                    \n                    pos = {\n                        'symbol': symbol,\n                        'type': direction,\n                        'entry_price': entry,\n                        'entry_time': datetime.now().isoformat(),\n                        'qty': abs(amt),\n                        'amount': abs(amt),\n                        'score': 55,\n                        'regime': 'trending',\n                        'ai_result': None,\n                        'order_result': {'success': True, 'message': '从 API 同步'},\n                        'high_24h': 0.0,\n                        'low_24h': 0.0,\n                        'tp1_price': tp_sl['tp1_price'],\n                        'sl_price': tp_sl['sl_price'],\n                        'peak_pnl': 0.0,\n                        'tp_pct': tp_sl.get('tp_pct', 0.04),\n                    }\n                    positions.append(pos)\n                    log.info(f\"✅ 同步持仓：{symbol} {pos['type']} @ ${pos['entry_price']:.2f}\")","new_string":"        else:\n            # 2026-03-28 老公指示：先加载本地缓存，保留止盈止损\n            old_positions = load_positions()\n            old_map = {p.get(\"symbol\", \"\"): p for p in old_positions}\n            log.info(f'📊 加载本地缓存 {len(old_positions)} 个持仓用于保留止盈止损')\n            \n            # 过滤有实际持仓的币种\n            positions = []\n            for p in api_positions:\n                amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n                entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：过滤粉尘仓位（名义价值<$5 不纳入）\n                if amt != 0 and abs(amt) * entry >= 5.0:\n                    # 转换为本地格式\n                    symbol = p['symbol']\n                    entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                    direction = 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG'\n                    \n                    # 查找旧缓存\n                    old = old_map.get(symbol, {})\n                    old_direction = old.get(\"type\", \"\")\n                    \n                    # 用默认参数计算新的 SL/TP（作为兜底）\n                    new_tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {})\n                    \n                    # 🔧 2026-06-16 修复：启动时保留三档移动止盈收窄过的 SL\n                    # 如果旧缓存里同方向且 SL 更紧（对持仓更有利），优先保留旧的\n                    old_sl = old.get(\"sl_price\", 0)\n                    new_sl = new_tp_sl[\"sl_price\"]\n                    old_tp1 = old.get(\"tp1_price\", 0)\n                    new_tp1 = new_tp_sl[\"tp1_price\"]\n                    \n                    sl_price = new_sl  # 默认用新值\n                    tp1_price = new_tp1\n                    peak_pnl = 0.0\n                    peak_price = 0.0\n                    tp_pct = new_tp_sl.get(\"tp_pct\", 0.04)\n                    \n                    if old_direction == direction and old_sl > 0:\n                        # 判断谁的 SL 更紧\n                        if direction == \"SHORT\":\n                            tighter = old_sl < new_sl  # 更低的 SL = 更紧\n                        else:  # LONG\n                            tighter = old_sl > new_sl  # 更高的 SL = 更紧\n                        \n                        if tighter:\n                            sl_price = old_sl\n                            log.info(f\"🔒 {symbol} 保留旧 SL {old_sl:.4f}（比新 SL {new_sl:.4f} 更紧）\")\n                        \n                        # 同时恢复峰值数据（三档移动止盈依赖）\n                        peak_pnl = old.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0)\n                        peak_price = old.get(\"peak_price\", 0)\n                        tp_pct = old.get(\"tp_pct\", tp_pct)\n                        tp1_price = old_tp1 if old_tp1 > 0 else new_tp1\n                        \n                        if peak_pnl > 0:\n                            log.info(f\"📈 {symbol} 恢复 peak_pnl={peak_pnl:.2%} peak_price={peak_price}\")\n                    \n                    pos = {\n                        'symbol': symbol,\n                        'type': direction,\n                        'entry_price': entry,\n                        'entry_time': old.get(\"entry_time\", datetime.now().isoformat()),\n                        'qty': abs(amt),\n                        'amount': abs(amt),\n                        'score': old.get(\"score\", 55),\n                        'regime': old.get(\"regime\", \"trending\"),\n                        'ai_result': None,\n                        'order_result': {'success': True, 'message': '从 API 同步'},\n                        'high_24h': old.get(\"high_24h\", 0.0),\n                        'low_24h': old.get(\"low_24h\", 0.0),\n                        'tp1_price': tp1_price,\n                        'sl_price': sl_price,\n                        'peak_pnl': peak_pnl,\n                        'peak_price': peak_price,\n                        'tp_pct': tp_pct,\n                    }\n                    positions.append(pos)\n                    status = \"恢复数据\" if peak_pnl > 0 else \"新同步\"\n                    log.info(f\"✅ 同步持仓({status})：{symbol} {pos['type']} @ ${pos['entry_price']:.2f} \"\n                             f\"SL={sl_price:.4f} TP={tp1_price:.4f}\")"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":955,"output":1925,"cacheRead":58240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61120,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781601312828}}
