e': peak_price,\n                        'tp_pct': tp_pct,\n                    }\n                    positions.append(pos)\n                    status = \"恢复数据\" if peak_pnl > 0 else \"新同步\"\n                    log.info(f\"✅ 同步持仓({status})：{symbol} {pos['type']} @ ${pos['entry_price']:.2f} \"\n                             f\"SL={sl_price:.4f} TP={tp1_price:.4f}\")","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1781601346548}}
{"type":"message","id":"6d907b44","parentId":"47663832","timestamp":"2026-06-16T09:15:57.382Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The code looks correct. Now we also have the state file's peak_pnl_map being applied later (around line 2449-2456). Since I'm now also restoring peak_pnl from the old position data, there could be a double-apply, but that's fine - the state file peak_pnl_map is a backup and both should be consistent.\n\nActually, wait - there's a subtlety. The `submit_initial_algo_orders(pos)` call at line ~2418 (in the old code) will now use the preserved SL/TP values. Good.\n\nLet me also think about the state file peak_pnl_map restore. With my change, peak_pnl is already restored from old_positions. The state file restore (line 2449-2456) will potentially overwrite it. That's fine - the state file should have the most recent values.\n\nLet me also check if there's a `save_positions(positions)` call after my changed section - from the earlier read, it was at line ~2396: `save_positions(positions)`. Good, the changes will be persisted.\n\nAnd the `submit_initial_algo_orders(pos)` loop at line ~2418 will submit the preserved SL/TP values to Binance. \n\nThe fix looks complete. Let me tell 老公 the summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"改完了。核心逻辑：\n\n**启动时不再丢弃旧缓存数据：**\n\n1. 加载 `old_positions` → 建 symbol 索引映射\n2. 对每个 API 持仓，查旧缓存里同币种同方向的数据\n3. **SL 对比**：如果旧 SL 更紧（被三档移动止盈收窄过），保留旧的，不用默认值覆盖\n4. **peak 数据**：peak_pnl、peak_price、tp_pct 全部恢复，三档移动止盈接续跑不断档\n5. 新开仓（旧缓存里没有的）走老的 calc_tp_sl 默认逻辑\n\n重启后 BNB 的 SL 会回到 617.8，不会再跳到 639.3 了。`kj` 一下试试 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1040,"output":726,"cacheRead":61184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62950,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781601346563}}
