{"type":"message","id":"7ee3bda8","parentId":"b1b7d140","timestamp":"2026-06-16T11:27:55.579Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Two problems:\n\n1. **BNB SL 丢失了！** 本地文件显示 BNB SL=0.0，Binance 上也没有 BNB 的止损单。但 peak_pnl 恢复了（3.3680%），peak_price 却是 0。\n\n2. **BNB peak_price 丢失了** - 之前是 611.69，现在是 0。\n\n问题分析：\n\n启动时恢复逻辑：\n- 旧缓存有 BNB SL=617.8069，新 SL=645.66（calc_tp_sl 默认 2%）\n- SHORT: tighter = old_sl < new_sl → 617.8 < 645.66 → True → 应该保留旧 SL\n- peak_pnl = old.get(\"peak_pnl\", 0) → 应该恢复\n\n但结果 SL=0.0。为什么？\n\n看一下代码逻辑更仔细。在启动重建持仓后，还有 `submit_initial_algo_orders(pos)` 调用。可能 `submit_initial_algo_orders` 检查了 SL 为 0 的情况就跳过了。\n\n不，等等。问题是 `sl_price = new_sl` 初始化，然后如果 tighter 条件成立，才设置 `sl_price = old_sl`。如果 tighter 条件不成立，就用默认 new_sl。但 617.8 < 645.66 是 True，所以应该保留了旧值。\n\n让我检查一下：可能 old_positions 在重启时已经被覆盖了（因为之前的启动已经写入了 SL=0 或 SL=639.3 的数据）。\n\n实际上，让我追踪一下时间线：\n1. 第一次 kj 前：crypto_positions.json 有 BNB SL=617.8, peak_pnl=3.37%, peak_price=611.69\n2. 第一次 kj（17:13 左右）：启动代码用 calc_tp_sl({}, {}) 重建，覆盖了 SL 和 peak 数据，保存到 crypto_positions.json\n3. 现在的 crypto_positions.json 里 BNB SL=0.0, peak_pnl=3.3680%, peak_price=0\n\n这不对。第一次 kj 应该生成 SL=645.66（calc_tp_sl 默认），不是 0.0。而且 peak_pnl 应该被清零。\n\n除非... 第二次 kj 时，old_positions 里的 BNB SL 已经是某个中间值了。\n\n让我仔细想想：\n- 第一次 kj 后写入 crypto_positions.json：BNB SL=645.66（calc_tp_sl 默认），peak_pnl=0, peak_price=0\n- 然后 state file peak_pnl_map 恢复了 peak_pnl=3.37%（通过 peak_pnl_map），但 peak_price 被恢复为默认值\n- 所以 crypto_positions.json 里：SL=645.66, peak_pnl=3.3680%, peak_price=0\n\n然后第二次 kj（刚才）：\n- old_positions 里有 BNB SL=639.3（wait... 不是 645.66）\n- 新 calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {}) 算得 SL=645.66\n- old_direction == direction (SHORT == SHORT) → True\n- tighter = old_sl(639.3) < new_sl(645.66) → True\n- 所以 sl_price = old_sl = 639.3\n\n但结果显示 SL=0.0。这很奇怪。\n\n等等，让我重新看一下。可能 crypto_positions.json 的数据在重启期间被修改了。或者 `old_positions` 加载时 BNB 数据有些问题。\n\n实际上，结果中 BNB SL=0.0 可能是 BUG：当 old.get(\"sl_price\", 0) 返回 0 时（如果旧缓存里的 BNB SL 就是 0），tighter 计算可能会出问题。\n\n让我检查一下：如果 old_sl = 0 会怎样？\n- old_direction == direction? 需要检查。如果 old 是空 dict，old.get(\"type\", \"\") 返回 \"\"，\"\" != \"SHORT\"，所以 old_direction != direction，整个 if 块会跳过，走默认值 new_sl = 645.66。\n\n所以不应该出现 SL=0.0。除非...\n\n让我看看 `save_positions` 和之后的状态恢复逻辑。在启动重建后有：\n```python\nsave_positions(positions)\n```\n然后有：\n```python\n# 应用恢复的 peak_pnl 到持仓（移动止盈关键数据）\nif peak_pnl_map and positions:\n    for pos in positions:\n        sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n        if sym in peak_pnl_map:\n            pos[\"peak_pnl\"] = peak_pnl_map[sym]\n    save_positions(positions)\n```\n\n这会覆盖 peak_pnl 但不会碰 sl_price。然后有：\n```python\nfor pos in positions:\n    submit_initial_algo_orders(pos)\n```\n\n看看 `submit_initial_algo_orders`：\n```python\ndef submit_initial_algo_orders(pos: dict):\n    if not AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n        return\n    sym = pos[\"symbol\"]\n    try:\n        typ = pos[\"type\"]\n        sl_price = pos.get(\"sl_price\")\n        tp_price = pos.get(\"tp1_price\")\n        if not sl_price or not tp_price:\n            return  # ← 如果 sl_price 是 0.0，这里会跳过！\n```\n\n如果 sl_price 是 0.0，`not sl_price` 为 True（Python 中 0.0 是 falsy），所以会 return，不提交止损单。但止盈单也会被跳过因为 `not sl_price` 触发了。\n\n但结果显示 TP 单是存在的（BNB TP=607.7），这说明 TP 被提交了。那 SL 应该是 > 0 的...\n\n等等，我再检查一下。如果 `if not sl_price or not tp_price:` 中 `not sl_price` 为 True，整个 if 块就执行了 return。所以如果 SL=0.0，TP 也不会提交。但查询显示 TP 存在。\n\nHmm，这可能意味着 SL 不是 0.0，但 crypto_positions.json 显示是 0.0。可能是 submit_initial_algo_orders 提交了 Algo 单后，SL 数据在某个地方被清了。\n\n或者，更简单的解释：second `save_positions` 调用（peak_pnl_map 恢复后）覆盖了 positions，但只更新了 peak_pnl，没有改变 sl_price。\n\n等等，让我重新分析。可能第一次 kj 的结果就不对，old_positions 里的 BNB SL 就是问题起点。\n\n让我直接帮老公修复当前状态。BNB 的 SL 应该恢复为 617.8。我可以手动修复 crypto_positions.json，然后让 monitor 在下个周期自动同步。\n\n实际上，让我仔细想想。当前问题：\n1. crypto_positions.json: BNB SL=0.0, peak_price=0\n2. Binance: BNB 有 TP 单 (607.7) 但没有 SL 单\n3. monitor 正在运行\n\nmonitor 在下个周期的 update_trailing_stop 会：\n- 查到 BNB peak_pnl=3.37%\n- tp_pct=0.04, first tier threshold = 0.04 * 0.5 = 2%\n- peak_pnl 3.37% > 2%，进入 Tier 2\n- Tier 2: gap = tp_pct * 0.25 = 0.01\n- 但如果 peak_price=0，计算会出问题\n\nneed to fix peak_price too. BNB's peak_price should be 611.69 (from earlier data).\n\nLet me manually fix both issues:\n1. Fix crypto_positions.json: BNB SL=617.8, peak_price=611.69\n2. Then the monitor's update_trailing_stop will re-evaluate and sync to Binance\n\nAlso, I should investigate why the SL restoration failed. The old_positions from the previous restart (first kj) had SL already reset to 639.3 (from calc_tp_sl), so when the second kj happened, old_sl was 639.3, and new_sl was 645.66. 639.3 < 645.66 so tighter=True, and SL would be set to 639.3, not 0.0.\n\nUnless... the crypto_positions.json was written by the first kj with BNB SL=639.3, and that was what was loaded as old_positions. Then on second kj:\n- old_sl = 639.3 (not 617.8, because first kj already lost it)\n- new_sl = 645.66\n- tighter = 639.3 < 645.66 → True\n- sl_price = 639.3\n\nBut the result shows 0.0. That's very strange.\n\nLet me check if there's some other code between the position rebuild and the save that could modify the SL.\n\nActually, wait. Let me look at `submit_initial_algo_orders` more carefully. Could it modify pos[\"sl_price\"]?\n\nAlso, there's a section after position rebuild that does orphan cleanup and algo submission. Let me check if there's any code that could set sl_price to 0.\n\nActually, I think I should just fix the data and move on. Let me manually set BNB SL=617.8 and peak_price=611.69 in crypto_positions.json, then see if the monitor picks it up.\n\nBut actually, maybe I should also check the peak_pnl_map approach. The state file might have the right data. Let me check crypto_state.json's peak_pnl_map.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"BNB 的止损单丢了！本地 SL 变成了 0，Binance 上也只有止盈没有止损。DOT 和 LINK 正常。我帮你手动恢复一下："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_QhCxL1pqCkNefDQs3auZ3006","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\npos_file = Path('crypto_positions.json')\ndata = json.loads(pos_file.read_text())\n\nfor p in data:\n    if p['symbol'] == 'BNB':\n        p['sl_price'] = 617.81\n        p['peak_price'] = 611.69\n        print(f'✅ BNB 修复: SL=617.81 peak_price=611.69')\n\npos_file.write_text(json.dumps(data, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\nprint('✅ crypto_positions.json 已更新')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":434,"output":4415,"cacheRead":64128,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68977,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781609229186}}
