silient:\n\n1. When old_sl is 0 but we have peak_pnl (meaning SL was lost but position has been tracked): don't just use calc_tp_sl default, instead use entry ± 2% as backup\n2. Add the BNB fix directly, then restart\n\nActually, I just realized: maybe my modifications to the file were NOT saved before the kj! Maybe the file write happened but was buffered/not flushed before the process exit or restart. Or maybe there's a file system cache issue.\n\nLet me try one more time: write the fix, verify it, and tell老公 to restart.\n\nBut this time I also need to make the code more bulletproof so this doesn't happen again. The key fix: when old_sl is 0 (broken data), the code should NOT silently produce a 0 SL. It should always fallback to calc_tp_sl minimum.\n\nWait, but looking at my code, it DOES fallback to calc_tp_sl when old_sl is 0. The `sl_price = new_sl` line handles this. So the SL should be 645.67, not 0.0.\n\nThe fact that it's 0.0 in the file means something ELSE is setting it to 0 after the position rebuild. Let me search for more places.\n\nLet me check if normalize_position or save_positions does something:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_AA6j6AJQh4ckvy0pFmX16761","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && sed -n '1030,1060p' crypto_signal_monitor.py","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":367,"output":1592,"cacheRead":87168,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89127,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781609828635}}
{"type":"message","id":"f00ec7fe","parentId":"05f496a5","timestamp":"2026-06-16T11:37:25.845Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_AA6j6AJQh4ckvy0pFmX16761","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def _merge_signals(self, symbol: str, signals: list) -> dict:\n        \"\"\"合并多个信号为一个\"\"\"\n        if len(signals) == 1:\n            return signals[0]\n        \n        # 分离开仓和平仓信号\n        opens = [s for s in signals if s.get('action') in ['开多', '开空']]\n        closes = [s for s in signals if s.get('action') in ['止盈', '止损', '平仓']]\n        \n        # 优先显示开仓，其次平仓\n        if opens:\n            latest_open = opens[-1]\n            total_pnl = sum(s.get('pnl', 0) for s in closes)\n            if total_pnl != 0:\n                latest_open['merged_pnl'] = total_pnl\n                latest_open['merged_close_count'] = len(closes)\n            return latest_open\n        elif closes:\n            # 合并所有平仓\n            total_pnl = sum(s.get('pnl', 0) for s in closes)\n            latest_close = closes[-1].copy()\n            latest_close['pnl'] = total_pnl\n            latest_close['merged_count'] = len(closes)\n            return latest_close\n        \n        return signals[-1]\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 十、AI 预测（DeepSeek，无调用次数/间隔限制）\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":112,"aggregated":"def _merge_signals(self, symbol: str, signals: list) -> dict:\n        \"\"\"合并多个信号为一个\"\"\"\n        if len(signals) == 1:\n            return signals[0]\n        \n        # 分离开仓和平仓信号\n        opens = [s for s in signals if s.get('action') in ['开多', '开空']]\n        closes = [s for s in signals if s.get('action') in ['止盈', '止损', '平仓']]\n        \n        # 优先显示开仓，其次平仓\n        if opens:\n            latest_open = opens[-1]\n            total_pnl = sum(s.get('pnl', 0) for s in closes)\n            if total_pnl != 0:\n                latest_open['merged_pnl'] = total_pnl\n                latest_open['merged_close_count'] = len(closes)\n            return latest_open\n        elif closes:\n            # 合并所有平仓\n            total_pnl = sum(s.get('pnl', 0) for s in closes)\n            latest_close = closes[-1].copy()\n            latest_close['pnl'] = total_pnl\n            latest_close['merged_count'] = len(closes)\n            return latest_close\n        \n        return signals[-1]\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 十、AI 预测（DeepSeek，无调用次数/间隔限制）\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1781609845831}}
