{"type":"message","id":"454b9352","parentId":"505bd412","timestamp":"2026-06-16T14:25:44.669Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公要我给币种排个活跃榜。我需要查一下当前监控的币种（BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, DOT, LINK, XRP）的活跃度指标，比如24小时成交量、波动率、ATR等。\n\n可以用脚本查或者直接用价格数据。让我看看有没有现成的工具。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_Ty7QmYCL7Wmn93puN0422625","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys, json\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\nsymbols = [\"BTC\", \"ETH\", \"SOL\", \"BNB\", \"DOT\", \"LINK\", \"XRP\"]\nresults = []\n\nfor sym in symbols:\n    try:\n        # 24hr ticker\n        ticker = bat.request(\"GET\", \"/fapi/v1/ticker/24hr\", {\"symbol\": f\"{sym}USDT\"})\n        if isinstance(ticker, dict) and \"lastPrice\" not in ticker:\n            continue\n            \n        price = float(ticker.get(\"lastPrice\", 0))\n        change_pct = float(ticker.get(\"priceChangePercent\", 0))\n        volume = float(ticker.get(\"quoteVolume\", 0))  # USDT volume\n        high = float(ticker.get(\"highPrice\", 0))\n        low = float(ticker.get(\"lowPrice\", 0))\n        vol_24h = volume\n        \n        # 波动范围\n        range_pct = (high - low) / low * 100 if low > 0 else 0\n        \n        results.append({\n            \"symbol\": sym,\n            \"price\": price,\n            \"change_pct\": change_pct,\n            \"volume_usdt\": vol_24h,\n            \"range_pct\": range_pct,\n        })\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"  {sym} 查询失败: {e}\", file=sys.stderr)\n\n# 按成交量排序（活跃度）\nresults.sort(key=lambda x: x[\"volume_usdt\"], reverse=True)\n\nprint(\"📊 币种活跃榜（24h 成交量 + 波动）\\n\")\nfor i, r in enumerate(results):\n    medal = [\"🥇\",\"🥈\",\"🥉\",\"4️⃣\",\"5️⃣\",\"6️⃣\",\"7️⃣\"][i]\n    vol_m = r[\"volume_usdt\"] / 1_000_000\n    print(f\"{medal} {r['symbol']:<5} ${r['price']:>8.2f}  \"\n          f\"{'🟢' if r['change_pct'] >= 0 else '🔴'}{abs(r['change_pct']):.1f}%  \"\n          f\"成交 {vol_m:,.0f}M USDT  振幅 {r['range_pct']:.2f}%\")\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":994,"output":726,"cacheRead":97792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99512,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781619932662}}
