{"type":"message","id":"4fc20595","parentId":"b164f13a","timestamp":"2026-06-16T14:26:09.726Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great results. Let me format this nicely.\n\nInteresting observations:\n- ETH, XRP, BTC are the top 3 by volume (all >100B USDT)\n- BNB had the biggest drop (-3.4%) \n- XRP has the highest amplitude (6.34%)\n- SOL has high amplitude (6.10%) but lower volume\n- Everyone is red today\n\nMarkets are all red. The high amplitude on XRP and SOL is notable.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"📊 币种活跃榜\n\n🥇 ETH $1779.5 🔴-1.6% 成交 130B 振幅 4.9%\n🥈 XRP $1.22 🔴-1.4% 成交 125B 振幅 6.3%\n🥉 BTC $65915 🔴-0.8% 成交 123B 振幅 2.6%\n4️⃣ BNB $604.6 🔴-3.4% 成交 103B 振幅 4.4%\n5️⃣ SOL $73.06 🔴-0.6% 成交 751M 振幅 6.1%\n6️⃣ DOT $1.00 🔴-2.9% 成交 617M 振幅 5.0%\n7️⃣ LINK $8.17 🔴-3.0% 成交 475M 振幅 5.3%\n\n全盘飘红，XRP 振幅最大（6.3%），BNB 跌最凶（-3.4%）。SOL 量不大但振幅也高，难怪 monitor 开了它的空单 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1013,"output":432,"cacheRead":99456,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":100901,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781619962401}}
