{"type":"message","id":"e2ddcafb","parentId":"45cbcef1","timestamp":"2026-06-16T14:28:31.937Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Here's the summary. 109 total trades.\n\nRanked by trade count:\n1. LINK - 28笔 🔴-13.0U\n2. SOL - 19笔 🟢+9.8U\n3. XRP - 18笔 🟢+9.0U\n4. ETH - 16笔 🔴-5.1U\n5. DOT - 14笔 🔴-11.8U\n6. BNB - 9笔 🟢+11.2U\n7. BTC - 5笔 🔴-4.6U\n\nInteresting: BNB has the fewest trades but best PnL. LINK has the most trades but worst PnL. SOL and XRP are good earners.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"📊 累计交易榜（Binance 真实成交共 109 笔）\n\n🥇 LINK 28 笔  🔴-13.0U\n🥈 SOL 19 笔  🟢+9.8U\n🥉 XRP 18 笔  🟢+9.0U\n4️⃣ ETH 16 笔  🔴-5.1U\n5️⃣ DOT 14 笔  🔴-11.8U\n6️⃣ BNB 9 笔  🟢+11.2U\n7️⃣ BTC 5 笔  🔴-4.6U\n\nLINK 最能折腾但亏最多，BNB 出手最少赚最多 👑 SOL 和 XRP 稳健，DOT 和 LINK 拖后腿了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":946,"output":495,"cacheRead":105600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107041,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781620105313}}
