{"type":"message","id":"9577be85","parentId":"a66d2d02","timestamp":"2026-06-16T14:29:46.043Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ET_ItLkTNcUJp1uZ4XVobXK0605","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-06-16.md","content":"# 2026-06-16 日志\n\n## 代码改动\n\n### 1. ATR 动态止损（持仓期实时跟跑）\n- **文件**：`crypto_signal_monitor.py`\n- **新增函数**：`update_atr_dynamic_stops(positions, indicators)` (line ~752)\n- **逻辑**：持仓期间每 60s 用当前 ATR 重算止损距离\n  - 分层：`<2%ATR→1x / <4%→1.5x / ≥4%→2x`，上限 15%\n  - 5 分钟冷却 + 0.1% 变化门槛 + 层级变化才更新 Binance 订单\n  - 已进入三档移动止盈（peak ≥ 50% tp）时跳过，避免冲突\n- **调用位置**：指标计算完成后 (`if scheduler.should(\"indicators\")`)\n\n### 2. 启动丢 SL 修复\n- **文件**：`crypto_signal_monitor.py`\n- **问题**：重启时 `calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {})` 用空指标重建持仓，覆盖了三档移动止盈收紧过的 SL\n- **修复**：\n  - 加载 old_positions 建索引后合并到新持仓\n  - 对比新旧 SL：如果旧 SL 更紧（SHORT: 更低 / LONG: 更高），保留旧的\n  - 恢复 peak_pnl、peak_price、tp_pct 字段\n  - 如果 old_sl=0 但有 peak_pnl：反推估算 SL（从 peak_price 推算）\n\n### 3. BNB 止损丢失事件\n- 第一次 kj 后 BNB SL 从 617.8 变成 639.3 → 639.3 变成 0\n- 根因：启动代码 old_sl=0 导致不匹配，submit_initial_algo_orders 跳过，SL 永久丢失\n- 修复过程：停 monitor → 手动修 crypto_positions.json → 直接创建 Binance Algo 单 → kj 重启\n- 最终 BNB SL 恢复到 617.8\n\n## 仓位变化\n- 日间：DOT SHORT / BNB SHORT / LINK SHORT\n- BNB 止盈平仓后新开 SOL 和 ETH\n- 晚间持仓：SOL SHORT / DOT SHORT / ETH SHORT / LINK SHORT（全绿）\n\n## 币种活跃榜（累计交易次数，Binance 109 笔）\n1. LINK 28 笔 🔴-13.0U\n2. SOL 19 笔 🟢+9.8U\n3. XRP 18 笔 🟢+9.0U\n4. ETH 16 笔 🔴-5.1U\n5. DOT 14 笔 🔴-11.8U\n6. BNB 9 笔 🟢+11.2U\n7. BTC 5 笔 🔴-4.6U\n\n## 待办\n- 两个改动已 deploy 并验证生效，无需额外操作\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":142,"output":761,"cacheRead":107264,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":108167,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781620172811}}
