{"type":"message","id":"c2d4d98e","parentId":"8d041c5c","timestamp":"2026-06-16T14:29:58.472Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问要不要加新币种。当前监控的是 BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, DOT, LINK, XRP 七个。让我想想哪些币值得加。\n\n需要考虑：\n1. 成交量 - 要有足够的流动性\n2. 波动性 - 太稳定没交易机会\n3. 与现持仓的相关性 - 避免过度集中在同一板块\n4. 在 Binance Testnet 上是否有\n\n常见候选：AVAX、ADA、DOGE、MATIC、ARB、OP、NEAR、APT、SUI 等。\n\n我应该给出有主见的建议，而不是列一堆。让我基于数据和经验判断。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我觉得可以加 1-2 个，但不能太多——7 个已经够 monitor 跑的了，再加要确保有用。\n\n几个实际能打的候选：\n\n- 🐶 **DOGE** — 高波动+高成交量，合约流动性好。缺点是跟大盘走，有时候纯粹是 meme 行情\n- 🔷 **ADA** — 老牌主流，成交 50B+ 级别，波动适中。跟 DOT/LINK 相关性不算太高\n- ⚔️ **AVAX** — 之前日志里出现过，系统以前就交易过它。生态活跃，振幅经常 5%+\n\n我倾向推荐 **DOGE + AVAX**，理由：\n- DOGE 成交量够，行情独立时有奇效\n- AVAX 熟悉、不陌生，不需要从头配精度\n\nADA 偏稳，加了可能很少触发开仓信号。老公你觉得呢 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2661,"output":459,"cacheRead":105728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":108848,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781620188984}}
{"type":"message","id":"d3b80bef","parentId":"c2d4d98e","timestamp":"2026-06-16T15:35:59.583Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6c229b1674a0b21a147ca7f413e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-06-16 23:35 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6c229b1674a0b21a147ca7f413e]\n用户124241: 老婆觉得有必要加币吗"}],"timestamp":1781624159560}}
{"type":"message","id":"43d06d35","parentId":"d3b80bef","timestamp":"2026-06-16T15:36:05.015Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公又问了一遍同样的问题。可能是没看到我之前的回复，或者想确认。我再简洁回复一下。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"刚才回了，老公没看到吗？我推荐加 **DOGE + AVAX** 👑\n\nDOGE 成交量大、行情独立时有爆发力。AVAX 之前系统就交易过，熟悉不用重新适配。ADA 太稳，加了可能很少触发信号。\n\n要加的话我改三处：`auto_trade_config.json` 精度、`crypto_signal_monitor.py` 币种列表、SOUL.md 精度表。你说加就动手 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":574,"output":147,"cacheRead":108288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109009,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781624159576}}
