{"type":"message","id":"ee5b25dd","parentId":"c7cb2978","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:20:57.373Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问能不能查到币安所有币的价格。他想做更全面的币种筛选，不只是我推荐的 DOGE 和 AVAX。\n\n我可以查，但 Binance 的 symbol 列表很长（几百个）。得先拉合约交易对列表，然后查 24h 行情数据，按成交量和波动筛。\n\n不过全量查询会很慢，几百个币种逐个查 ticker 不太现实。我可以用 `ticker/24hr` 端点一次获取所有 symbol（不带 symbol 参数），不过这个也很大。\n\n让我试试分步来：先拉 symbol 列表，再批量查 ticker。或者直接用 `/fapi/v1/ticker/24hr` 不带参数获取全部，然后筛选 USDT 合约对，按成交量排序取头部。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_gS3h6suZtBlnIEr98h8O5331","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys, json\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\nfrom urllib.request import urlopen, Request\nfrom urllib.parse import urlencode\n\n# 一次拉全部 USDT 合约对 ticker（不带 symbol 参数）\n# 这个接口返回量大，取一次就够了\ntry:\n    tickers = bat.request(\"GET\", \"/fapi/v1/ticker/24hr\")\n    if not isinstance(tickers, list):\n        print(\"ERROR: 非预期返回格式\")\n        sys.exit(1)\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"ERROR: {e}\")\n    sys.exit(1)\n\n# 筛选 USDT 合约，按成交量排序\nusdt_pairs = [t for t in tickers if t.get('symbol','').endswith('USDT')]\nusdt_pairs.sort(key=lambda x: float(x.get('quoteVolume', 0)), reverse=True)\n\n# 取 Top 30\nprint(f\"📊 币安合约 USDT 交易对 Top 30（按 24h 成交量）\\n\")\nfor i, t in enumerate(usdt_pairs[:30]):\n    sym = t['symbol'].replace('USDT', '')\n    price = float(t['lastPrice'])\n    vol_m = float(t['quoteVolume']) / 1_000_000\n    chg = float(t['priceChangePercent'])\n    h = float(t['highPrice'])\n    l = float(t['lowPrice'])\n    amp = (h-l)/l*100 if l else 0\n    \n    arrow = \"🟢\" if chg >= 0 else \"🔴\"\n    idx = f\"{i+1:2d}\"\n    print(f\"{idx}. {sym:<8} ${price:>10.4f}  {arrow}{abs(chg):>5.1f}%  \"\n          f\"成交 {vol_m:>8,.0f}M  振幅 {amp:>5.1f}%\")\nPYEOF","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":807,"output":835,"cacheRead":108800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":110442,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781626842822}}
