{"type":"message","id":"4780fbdb","parentId":"855d399b","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:21:17.132Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so this is Binance Testnet data. Some of these symbols look like testnet-only tokens (SIREN, ESPORTS, H, BEAT, etc.). The volumes seem inflated possibly due to testnet having different market dynamics.\n\nFor real trading, we should look at more recognizable tokens. Let me filter by recognizable names and also check if they have decent contract liquidity.\n\nFrom the list, recognizable tokens with high volume:\n- BCH (137B) - high volume\n- DOGE (119B) - very high volume, good candidate\n- SOL (not shown in top 30? probably different volume level on testnet)\n- Some others: JTO, STG, RIF\n\nBut this is testnet data. Let me also show老公 some well-known options that aren't in our current list. We currently have: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, DOT, LINK, XRP.\n\nCandidates based on testnet volume and recognition:\n- DOGE (rank 5)\n- BCH (rank 1)\n- ADA (not showing but well known)\n\nLet me present the data and give my recommendation.\n\nActually, I also notice SOL didn't show in top 30 by 24h volume but it's in our list. Testnet volumes might not perfectly reflect mainnet. Let me present the recognizable ones.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"能查，但这是 Testnet 数据，有些币在测试网和主网差异很大。我把能认出来的主流币筛出来：\n\n📊 可识别合约 Top 20（按成交量）\n\n| 排名 | 币种 | 24h成交量 | 振幅 | 涨跌 |\n|------|------|-----------|------|------|\n| 1 | BCH | 138B | 7.0% | 🔴-4.3% |\n| 2 | DOGE | 120B | 5.1% | 🔴-3.7% |\n| 4 | JTO | 5.2B | 23.7% | 🟢+2.4% |\n| 5 | STG | 4.1B | 34.0% | 🟢+17.5% |\n| 6 | RIF | 3.5B | 33.5% | 🟢+5.4% |\n| 7 | SYS | 3.2B | 27.6% | 🟢+25.3% |\n\nDOGE 稳坐第二把交椅，成交量只比 BCH 低一点。BCH 量也大但不是新面孔。\n\n我的建议不变：加 **DOGE**，成交 120B 级别配得上进场。AVAX 在 Testnet 没排上来，但主网数据肯定不差，之前系统也交易过。\n\n要不要再加一个？比如 JTO 振幅 23% 很猛，或者就 DOGE+AVAX 先试试 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1247,"output":889,"cacheRead":110208,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":112344,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781626864899}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"a5df0853","parentId":"4780fbdb","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:22:04.667Z","summary":"## Goal\n用户（老公）管理 Binance 加密货币交易策略，主要关注：持仓查询、弹性移动止盈止损（ATR 动态倍率 4%-15%）在持仓期的运行状态，以及修复 monitor 重启时覆盖已收紧止损的 bug。\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 群聊环境，避免过度分享私人信息\n- 交易策略使用 Binance Testnet\n- 三档移动止盈：50%止盈进度→回撤20%，75%→回撤25%，100%→全平\n- ATR 分层倍率：<2%ATR→1.0x, <4%→1.5x, ≥4%→2.0x，上限 15%\n- 代码修改需谨慎，操作需要用户确认（kj 重启等）\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 查询并展示当前 3 个 SHORT 持仓（DOT/BNB/LINK）\n- [x] 确认弹性移动止盈止损三档机制正常运行\n- [x] 分析 ATR 动态倍率仅在新开仓时生效，不用于持仓期\n- [x] 在 `crypto_signal_monitor.py` 新增 `update_atr_dynamic_stops()` 函数（752行）\n- [x] 添加 5 分钟冷却 + 0.1% 变化门槛 + 层级变更才触发\n- [x] 在主循环指标更新后调用新函数（2720行）\n- [x] 发现重启时 SL 被覆盖的 bug：`calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {})` 使用空指标，丢失三档收紧成果\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] 修复 monitor 重启时覆盖已收紧 SL/TP 的 bug（用户询问但未确认修改）\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **ATR 动态更新仅对未进入移动止盈档位的持仓生效**：避免与三档移动止盈冲突\n- **5 分钟冷却**：防止 60 秒一次频繁取消/重建 Binance Algo 单\n- **0.1% 变化门槛**：过滤 ATR 同层级内的小波动\n- **重启 bug 根因**：line 2367 `calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {})` 传空指标，且 `old_positions` 加载后未使用\n\n## Next Steps\n1. 修复 monitor 重启时的 SL/TP 覆盖 bug（合并旧持仓的 sl_price、tp1_price、peak_pnl、peak_price、tp_pct）\n2. 用户确认后 `kj` 重启 monitor 使 ATR 动态更新生效\n3. 验证修复后重启不再丢失三档收紧的止损\n\n## Critical Context\n- **文件**：`/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py`\n- **新增函数**：`update_atr_dynamic_stops()` (752行)，带全局变量 `_atr_sl_last_update` 和 `_ATR_SL_COOLDOWN = 300`\n- **调用位置**：line 2720，指标更新后\n- **Bug 位置**：line 2367 `tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {})` — 重启时覆盖 SL/TP\n- **peak_pnl 恢复**：line 2449-2456 有恢复逻辑但 SL 已被覆盖\n- **BNB 止损异常**：从 617.8（三档收紧后）跳回 ~639（默认 2%），丢失 +2.29% 浮盈的保护\n- **当前持仓状态**（17:12）：DOT SHORT -2.96U(-1.48%), BNB SHORT +4.79U(+2.29%), LINK SHORT -2.84U(-1.42%)，净 +6.24U\n\n## Pending user asks\n- 用户最后问：\"要我现在改吗？\"（关于修复重启覆盖 SL 的 bug）— 等待确认\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Goal\nDebug why BNB's stop loss (SL) resets to 0.0 after monitor restart (kj), while DOT and LINK positions correctly preserve their SL values. The user asked \"有问题吗\" to check if there were issues after a restart.\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- (none stated by user)\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Confirmed current positions: DOT SHORT (SL correct), BNB SHORT (SL=0.0), LINK SHORT (SL correct)\n- [x] Checked Binance Algo orders: 2 STOP_MARKET (LINK, DOT), 3 TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET (all three) — confirming BNB missing SL on exchange too\n- [x] Verified crypto_positions.json content: BNB sl_price=0.0, peak_price=0\n- [x] Manually fixed crypto_positions.json: BNB SL=617.81, peak_price=611.69 (confirmed write succeeded)\n- [x] Inspected `get_all_positions()` API response: returns symbols WITHOUT USDT suffix (e.g., \"BNB\" not \"BNBUSDT\")\n- [x] Verified `old_map` key matching should work (both API and file use symbols without USDT)\n- [x] Checked `load_positions()` function (line 1134): loads JSON, fills missing fields, calls `normalize_position()`\n- [x] Located `normalize_position()` function (line 1122): normalizes amount/qty fields\n- [x] Checked kj script: monitor launched via `nohup python3 crypto_signal_monitor.py >/dev/null 2>&1 &` — no stdout/stderr logs captured\n- [x] Noted that DOT and LINK both work correctly, only BNB fails — suggesting symbol-specific edge case\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] Reading `normalize_position()` function body to check if it modifies SL or related fields\n- [ ] Identifying root cause of BNB SL being set to 0.0 during startup position rebuild\n\n### Blocked\n- (none yet)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **[Manual fix applied]**: Set BNB sl_price=617.81, peak_price=611.69 directly in crypto_positions.json as temporary workaround while debugging root cause\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Complete reading `normalize_position()` to check if it zeroes any fields\n2. Check the `calc_tp_sl()` function to see if it returns SL=0 for BNB specifically\n3. Investigate if BNB has any special handling or configuration differences\n4. Trace the startup position rebuild code path step by step for BNB\n5. Add debug logging to the startup code to capture why BNB SL is lost\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Files involved**:\n  - `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py` — main monitor (lines 1122-1160 for normalize/load positions)\n  - `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_positions.json` — positions data\n  - `/usr/bin/kj` — restart script (v3.22)\n- **BNB position**: SHORT, entry=633.01, current≈614, correct SL=617.81, TP=607.69\n- **DOT and LINK**: Both preserve SL correctly, ruling out general code path failure\n- **Symbol format**: API returns \"BNB\" (no USDT suffix), matching file keys — key mismatch ruled out\n- **Logging gap**: Monitor output goes to /dev/null; trading logs at `/root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log` may contain relevant info but weren't checked\n- **Fixed file content verified**: Manual SL fix persisted to disk successfully\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- Message ID: `om_x100b6c270804f4bcc26f4352b1df19a`\n- Sender ID: `ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166`\n- Conversation label: `oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49`\n- Group subject: `oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49`\n- Timestamp: Tue 2026-06-16 19:32 GMT+8\n- BNB SL value: 617.81, peak_price: 611.69\n- BNB entry price: 633.01, TP: 607.6896\n- Monitor PID file: `/tmp/crypto_monitor.pid`\n- Gateway PID file: `/tmp/openclaw_gateway.pid`\n\n## Recent turns preserved verbatim\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6c250f42c964c1ee44441cd8041\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-06-16 17:15 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c