{"type":"message","id":"ad845af3","parentId":"96a11e84","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:24:06.338Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问 SPACE（之前列表里的 SPACE 排名17，$0.0075）是不是在列表里。在的，排名17，价格 $0.0075。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"看到了，在第17名：\n\nSPACE $0.0075 🟢+17.2% 成交 6.7B 振幅 42%\n\n价格很低但振幅挺猛，17% 涨幅。怎么，老公看上这个了？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":36163,"output":129,"cacheRead":18688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54980,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781627039029}}
{"type":"message","id":"4aefba2c","parentId":"ad845af3","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:26:50.360Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6c23dab7c0a4b212e24b1587b73\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6c2333b034a4b2ade61150edd34\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-06-17 00:26 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@_user_1 你能查到币安的所有币的价格吗\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6c23dab7c0a4b212e24b1587b73]\n用户124241: [Replying to: \"@_user_1 你能查到币安的所有币的价格吗\"]\n\n意思就是你能看见所有币安的币种那不限制你买币的种类不是能赶上每一个行情?"}],"timestamp":1781627210322}}
{"type":"message","id":"3f2e9044","parentId":"4aefba2c","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:27:10.109Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公的意思是说，既然我能查到币安所有币种，那不限我买币种类的话，不就每个行情都能赶上？\n\n这个想法有道理但有几个现实问题：\n\n1. **精度问题**：每加一个币种需要知道它的合约精度（tickSize/stepSize），否则下单会失败\n2. **流动性问题**：Testnet 上很多小币流动性很差，真实主网也可能滑点大\n3. **系统复杂度**：每加一个币，monitor 要多监听一个 WebSocket、多算一套指标、多走一套信号\n4. **资金限制**：只有 100U Testnet，最大 4 个持仓，全开也就覆盖 4 个币种\n\n但是，逻辑上是对的——如果能动态获取精度、自动适配，理论上可以在主流行情中挑最好的。可以设计成：\n\n- 维护一个\"候选池\"，比如 20 个币，都拉指标但不全开仓\n- 开仓时从候选池里挑信号最强的 4 个\n- 精度从 Binance API 动态获取（`/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo`），不硬编码\n\n这个方向跟现在的\"固定 7 币种\"架构不同，需要改不少。但长期看是更聪明的做法。\n\n我应该告诉老公：道理对，但有几个实际限制（精度、资金、复杂度），如果要做可以逐步来。先加 DOGE 试试水，再考虑扩展到动态候选池。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"道理对，但有几个现实限制：\n\n**1. 精度门槛**\n每个币种的 tickSize/stepSize 不一样，用错了直接下单失败——之前 DOT 精度超限的坑就是例子。得先从 `/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo` 动态取精度，不能硬编码。\n\n**2. 资金上限**\n100U Testnet，最多 4 个仓位，就算 500 个币我也只能挑 4 个开。\n\n**3. 系统开销**\n每加一个币，多一条 WebSocket、一套指标计算、一份信号判断。20 个币一起跑没问题，500 个不行。\n\n**可以这样做：**\n- 建一个 20-30 个币的「候选池」，全拉指标但不全开\n- 信号触发时从池子里挑分数最高的 4 个开\n- 精度从 API 动态获取，不用手写\n\n这个方向比现在固定 7 币种聪明，但要改不少代码。先加 DOGE 试试水，还是直接上候选池 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":515,"output":852,"cacheRead":54784,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56151,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781627210338}}
{"type":"message","id":"49c8732f","parentId":"3f2e9044","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:30:39.036Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6c23ec5ac4a0b4acce54a11995b\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6c2333b034a4b2ade61150edd34\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-06-17 00:30 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@_user_1 你能查到币安的所有币的价格吗\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6c23ec5ac4a0b4acce54a11995b]\n用户124241: [Replying to: \"@_user_1 你能查到币安的所有币的价格吗\"]\n\n如果存20个币的话，算上现在的应该踢掉哪些加哪些"}],"timestamp":1781627439017}}
{"type":"message","id":"11b7b2bb","parentId":"49c8732f","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:30:52.150Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问怎么精简20个币的候选池。现在有7个：BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, DOT, LINK, XRP。加上我推荐的 DOGE 和 AVAX，还要再选大约11个。\n\n我来帮他想想：哪些该踢，哪些该加。\n\n当前7个分析：\n- BTC/ETH - 必须留，大盘\n- SOL - 高频交易，必须留\n- BNB - 虽然交易少但赚钱（+11.2U），留\n- DOT - 亏钱（-11.8U），振幅一般，可踢\n- LINK - 交易最活跃但亏最多（-13.0U），成交量好留着\n- XRP - 赚钱（+9.0U），成交量高，留着\n\n从 Testnet Top 30 里可挑的知名币：\n- DOGE - 必加\n- BCH - 成交量第一\n- AVAX - 推了\n- ADA - 老公可能想加\n- JTO - 振幅大\n- STG - 振幅34%\n- RIF - 振幅33%\n\n还需要更多主流币。让我查查有没有遗漏的知名合约。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_dNuDJzmYS4SKOkv0r76w7264","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys, json\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\ntickers = bat.request(\"GET\", \"/fapi/v1/ticker/24hr\")\nusdt = [t for t in tickers if t['symbol'].endswith('USDT')]\nusdt.sort(key=lambda x: float(x['quoteVolume']), reverse=True)\n\n# 已知主流币关键词（合约名）\nknown = {'BTC','ETH','SOL','BNB','ADA','DOGE','XRP','DOT','LINK','AVAX',\n         'LTC','BCH','ATOM','APT','ARB','OP','SUI','SEI','NEAR','FIL',\n         'GRT','CRV','UNI','AAVE','MATIC','IMX','INJ','TIA','WIF','PEPE',\n         'SHIB','FET','RNDR','TAO','STRK','ORDI','JUP','JTO','ETC','TRX',\n         '1000PEPE','1000SHIB','1000FLOKI','WLD','W','PYTH','ENA','FTM'}\n\nfound = []\nfor t in usdt:\n    sym = t['symbol'].replace('USDT','')\n    if sym.upper() in known or sym in known:\n        vol = float(t['quoteVolume'])/1_000_000\n        chg = float(t['priceChangePercent'])\n        h, l = float(t['highPrice']), float(t['lowPrice'])\n        amp = (h-l)/l*100 if l else 0\n        found.append((sym, vol, amp, chg, float(t['lastPrice'])))\n\nfound.sort(key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)\nprint(f\"找到 {len(found)} 个可识别主流合约\\n\")\nfor s, v, a, c, p in found:\n    arrow = \"🟢\" if c >= 0 else \"🔴\"\n    print(f\"{s:<10} 量 {v:>8.0f}M  振幅 {a:>5.1f}%  {arrow}{c:>+5.1f}%  ${p:.4f}\")\nPYEOF","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":617,"output":1055,"cacheRead":55296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56968,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781627439031}}
