{"type":"message","id":"bfb73ad5","parentId":"433b1cb1","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:46:30.953Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公说要加 SPACE，先讨论一下工程量。我看看需要改哪些地方：\n\n1. **auto_trade_config.json** - 加精度配置（coin info, tickSize, stepSize）\n2. **crypto_signal_monitor.py** - 币种列表，WebSocket 订阅，指标计算\n3. **SOUL.md** - 精度表\n4. **精度获取** - 从 `/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo` 动态获取\n\n但 SPACE 是 Testnet 上的币，需要确认精度。另外需要确认主网 Binance 上 SPACE 是否存在。\n\n让我先查一下精度，然后列出工程清单。\n\n其实我之前说过要改三处，但如果要改成动态精度（20 币池），改的会更多。老公现在说\"先讨论\"，那我不着急动手，先把前端后端的改动量理清楚。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_9AOm8iuPweJbCF0aGPr16953","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\n# 查 SPACE 合约精度\ninfo = bat.request(\"GET\", \"/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo\")\nspace = [s for s in info.get('symbols',[]) if s.get('symbol')=='SPACEUSDT']\nif space:\n    s = space[0]\n    tick = s.get('filters', [{}])\n    print(f\"合约状态: {s.get('contractStatus')}\")\n    print(f\"tickSize: {[f for f in tick if f.get('filterType')=='PRICE_FILTER'][0].get('tickSize')}\")\n    print(f\"stepSize: {[f for f in tick if f.get('filterType')=='LOT_SIZE'][0].get('stepSize')}\")\n    print(f\"minQty: {[f for f in tick if f.get('filterType')=='LOT_SIZE'][0].get('minQty')}\")\nelse:\n    print(\"⚠️ SPACEUSDT 合约未找到\")\nPYEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":555,"output":685,"cacheRead":60672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61912,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781628382153}}
